# This tree is a Linux desktop configuration. Its blobs must be LF: a CR in a
# shell script (hypr/scripts/*.sh, ml4w/scripts/*, waybar/launch.sh) makes the
# shell on the target fail every line of it, and the target has no editor to
# fix that with. The repo is maintained on Windows, where a global
# core.autocrlf can quietly put CRLF back, so state the policy in the repo
# rather than relying on every checkout's git config.
* text=auto eol=lf
